<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

    <meta charset="UTF-8">

    <meta
        name="viewport"
        content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover"
    >

    <meta
        name="theme-color"
        content="#0b0b0a"
    >

    <meta
        name="description"
        content="AKSH Stories — reflections on mental wellness, human experiences and the moments that shape us."
    >

    <meta
        name="robots"
        content="index, follow"
    >

    <title>AKSH — Stories</title>


    <!-- =================================================
         FAVICON
    ================================================== -->

    <link
        rel="icon"
        type="image/png"
        href="aksh-icon.PNG"
    >


    <!-- =================================================
         FONTS
    ================================================== -->

    <link
        rel="preconnect"
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"
    >

    <link
        rel="preconnect"
        href="https://fonts.gstatic.com"
        crossorigin
    >

    <link
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet"
    >


    <!-- =================================================
         PAGE STYLES
    ================================================== -->

    <style>

        :root {
            --ink: #151311;
            --soft-ink: #514b45;
            --paper: #f2eee7;
            --warm: #e3d9cb;
            --line: rgba(21, 19, 17, 0.15);
            --white: #faf8f4;
            --dark: #11100f;
        }


        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }


        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }


        body {
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 100%;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            background: var(--paper);
            color: var(--ink);
            font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
        }


        body.menu-open {
            overflow: hidden;
        }


        a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }


        button {
            font: inherit;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }


        /* =================================================
           PAGE TRANSITION
        ================================================== */

        #pageTransition {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            z-index: 9999;
            background: var(--dark);
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
            pointer-events: none;
            transition:
                opacity 0.8s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1),
                transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);
        }


        #pageTransition.ready {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(-100%);
        }


        #pageTransition.active {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }


        /* =================================================
           HEADER
        ================================================== */

        .stories-header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 88px;
            z-index: 100;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding:
                env(safe-area-inset-top)
                34px
                0;
            pointer-events: none;
        }


        .stories-brand,
        #menuButton {
            pointer-events: auto;
        }


        .stories-brand {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            display: block;
        }


        .stories-brand img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: contain;
            display: block;
        }


        #menuButton {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            border: 0;
            background: transparent;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: flex-end;
            gap: 7px;
        }


        #menuButton span {
            display: block;
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--ink);
            transition: width 0.3s ease;
        }


        #menuButton span:first-child {
            width: 29px;
        }


        #menuButton span:last-child {
            width: 19px;
        }


        #menuButton:hover span:first-child {
            width: 19px;
        }


        #menuButton:hover span:last-child {
            width: 29px;
        }


        /* =================================================
           HERO
        ================================================== */

        .stories-hero {
            min-height: 100svh;
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            overflow: hidden;
            background:
                radial-gradient(
                    circle at 80% 20%,
                    rgba(255,255,255,0.7),
                    transparent 34%
                ),
                linear-gradient(
                    135deg,
                    #eee8df,
                    #ded3c5
                );
        }


        .hero-glow {
            position: absolute;
            width: 65vw;
            height: 65vw;
            max-width: 850px;
            max-height: 850px;
            right: -18%;
            top: 5%;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background:
                radial-gradient(
                    circle,
                    rgba(255,255,255,0.6),
                    transparent 68%
                );
            filter: blur(10px);
            pointer-events: none;
        }


        .hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 68px));
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 150px 0 110px;
        }


        .hero-label {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            color: var(--soft-ink);
            font-size: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 0.24em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }


        .hero-label::before {
            content: "";
            width: 42px;
            height: 1px;
            background: currentColor;
        }


        .hero-title {
            max-width: 1050px;
            font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
            font-size: clamp(
                75px,
                13vw,
                175px
            );
            font-weight: 400;
            line-height: 0.82;
            letter-spacing: -0.06em;
        }


        .hero-title em {
            display: block;
            margin-left: clamp(25px, 10vw, 150px);
            font-style: italic;
        }


        .hero-intro {
            width: min(550px, 100%);
            margin-top: 60px;
            margin-left: clamp(0px, 12vw, 170px);
            color: var(--soft-ink);
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.9;
        }


        .hero-scroll {
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            bottom: 35px;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            color: var(--soft-ink);
            font-size: 9px;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }


        .scroll-line {
            width: 1px;
            height: 45px;
            background: rgba(21,19,17,0.3);
            transform-origin: top;
            animation: scrollPulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }


        @keyframes scrollPulse {

            0%,
            100% {
                opacity: 0.3;
                transform: scaleY(0.35);
            }

            50% {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: scaleY(1);
            }

        }


        /* =================================================
           INTRO
        ================================================== */

        .stories-introduction {
            background: var(--dark);
            color: var(--white);
            padding:
                clamp(110px, 15vw, 220px)
                0;
        }


        .content-width {
            width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 68px));
            margin: 0 auto;
        }


        .section-number {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            color: rgba(250,248,244,0.42);
            font-size: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 0.25em;
        }


        .introduction-title {
            max-width: 1000px;
            font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
            font-size: clamp(
                50px,
                7vw,
                105px
            );
            font-weight: 400;
            line-height: 0.98;
            letter-spacing: -0.04em;
        }


        .introduction-title em {
            color: #d4c6b6;
            font-style: italic;
        }


        .introduction-copy {
            max-width: 590px;
            margin-top: 70px;
            margin-left: auto;
            color: rgba(250,248,244,0.62);
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.9;
        }


        /* =================================================
           STORIES GRID
        ================================================== */

        .stories-library {
            background: #e9e3db;
            padding:
                clamp(110px, 14vw, 200px)
                0;
        }


        .library-heading {
            max-width: 800px;
            font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
            font-size: clamp(
                48px,
                6vw,
                86px
            );
            font-weight: 400;
            line-height: 1;
            letter-spacing: -0.04em;
        }


        .library-heading em {
            font-style: italic;
        }


        .library-copy {
            max-width: 560px;
            margin-top: 35px;
            color: var(--soft-ink);
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.9;
        }


        .stories-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 1px;
            margin-top: 90px;
            background: var(--line);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
        }


        .story-card {
            min-height: 390px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 38px;
            background: #f3eee7;
            transition:
                background 0.45s ease,
                transform 0.45s ease;
        }


        .story-card:hover {
            background: #e4dbcf;
        }


        .story-number {
            color: rgba(21,19,17,0.42);
            font-size: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
        }


        .story-card-content {
            max-width: 510px;
        }


        .story-category {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            color: var(--soft-ink);
            font-size: 9px;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }


        .story-title {
            font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
            font-size: clamp(
                34px,
                4vw,
                54px
            );
            font-weight: 400;
            line-height: 0.98;
        }


        .story-description {
            margin-top: 22px;
            color: var(--soft-ink);
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }


        .story-arrow {
            align-self: flex-end;
            font-size: 23px;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }


        .story-card:hover .story-arrow {
            transform: translateX(7px);
        }


        /* =================================================
           CLOSING
        ================================================== */

        .stories-closing {
            background: #171513;
            color: var(--white);
            padding:
                clamp(120px, 17vw, 240px)
                0;
        }


        .closing-label {
            color: rgba(250,248,244,0.42);
            font-size: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 0.24em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }


        .closing-title {
            max-width: 950px;
            margin-top: 35px;
            font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
            font-size: clamp(
                60px,
                9vw,
                135px
            );
            font-weight: 400;
            line-height: 0.87;
            letter-spacing: -0.05em;
        }


        .closing-title em {
            color: #d5c5b3;
            font-style: italic;
        }


        .closing-copy {
            max-width: 520px;
            margin-top: 60px;
            margin-left: auto;
            color: rgba(250,248,244,0.62);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.9;
        }


        .closing-link {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 18px;
            margin-top: 55px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(250,248,244,0.45);
            font-size: 11px;
            letter-spacing: 0.16em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition:
                gap 0.3s ease,
                border-color 0.3s ease;
        }


        .closing-link:hover {
            gap: 26px;
            border-color: var(--white);
        }


        /* =================================================
           FOOTER
        ================================================== */

        .stories-footer {
            background: #0c0b0a;
            color: var(--white);
            padding:
                75px 0
                calc(
                    75px +
                    env(safe-area-inset-bottom)
                );
        }


        .footer-brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 18px;
        }


        .footer-brand img {
            width: 52px;
            height: 52px;
            object-fit: contain;
        }


        .footer-brand-text {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 5px;
        }


        .footer-brand-text strong {
            font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
            font-size: 27px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }


        .footer-brand-text span {
            color: rgba(250,248,244,0.45);
            font-size: 9px;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }


        .footer-bottom {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 25px;
            margin-top: 85px;
            padding-top: 24px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(250,248,244,0.13);
            color: rgba(250,248,244,0.42);
            font-size: 10px;
        }


        /* =================================================
           NAVIGATION
        ================================================== */

        #navigation {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            z-index: 500;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            background: #11100f;
            color: var(--white);
            opacity: 0;
            visibility: hidden;
            pointer-events: none;
            transition:
                opacity 0.45s ease,
                visibility 0.45s ease;
        }


        #navigation.open {
            opacity: 1;
            visibility: visible;
            pointer-events: auto;
        }


        #closeMenu {
            position: absolute;
            top: 30px;
            right: 34px;
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            border: 0;
            background: transparent;
            cursor: pointer;
        }


        #closeMenu::before,
        #closeMenu::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            width: 29px;
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--white);
        }


        #closeMenu::before {
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(45deg);
        }


        #closeMenu::after {
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-45deg);
        }


        .navigation-inner {
            width: min(1100px, calc(100% - 68px));
            margin: 0 auto;
        }


        .navigation-label {
            margin-bottom: 35px;
            color: rgba(250,248,244,0.4);
            font-size: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 0.24em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }


        .navigation-links {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 0 80px;
        }


        .navigation-links a {
            display: flex;
            align-items: baseline;
            gap: 18px;
            padding: 17px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(250,248,244,0.12);
            font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
            font-size: clamp(
                30px,
                4vw,
                50px
            );
            line-height: 1;
            transition:
                color 0.3s ease,
                padding-left 0.3s ease;
        }


        .navigation-links a span {
            color: rgba(250,248,244,0.32);
            font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
            font-size: 9px;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        }


        .navigation-links a:hover {
            padding-left: 10px;
            color: #d5c5b3;
        }


        /* =================================================
           RESPONSIVE
        ================================================== */

        @media (max-width: 900px) {

            .stories-header {
                height: 76px;
                padding:
                    env(safe-area-inset-top)
                    22px
                    0;
            }


            .stories-brand {
                width: 42px;
                height: 42px;
            }


            #menuButton {
                width: 44px;
                height: 44px;
            }


            .content-width,
            .hero-content,
            .navigation-inner {
                width: min(
                    calc(100% - 44px),
                    720px
                );
            }


            .hero-title {
                font-size: clamp(
                    64px,
                    16vw,
                    110px
                );
            }


            .stories-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }


            .navigation-links {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 0;
            }

        }


        @media (max-width: 600px) {

            .stories-header {
                height: 70px;
                padding:
                    env(safe-area-inset-top)
                    17px
                    0;
            }


            .stories-brand {
                width: 38px;
                height: 38px;
            }


            #menuButton {
                width: 42px;
                height: 42px;
            }


            .content-width,
            .hero-content {
                width: calc(100% - 36px);
            }


            .hero-content {
                padding:
                    120px 0
                    100px;
            }


            .hero-title {
                font-size: clamp(
                    61px,
                    19vw,
                    90px
                );
            }


            .hero-title em {
                margin-left: 6vw;
            }


            .hero-intro {
                margin-top: 43px;
                margin-left: 0;
                font-size: 14px;
            }


            .hero-scroll {
                bottom: 24px;
            }


            .stories-introduction {
                padding:
                    100px 0
                    120px;
            }


            .introduction-title {
                font-size: clamp(
                    45px,
                    13vw,
                    68px
                );
            }


            .introduction-copy {
                margin-top: 50px;
                margin-left: 0;
                font-size: 14px;
            }


            .stories-library {
                padding:
                    100px 0
                    120px;
            }


            .library-heading {
                font-size: clamp(
                    43px,
                    12vw,
                    64px
                );
            }


            .library-copy {
                font-size: 14px;
            }


            .stories-grid {
                margin-top: 65px;
            }


            .story-card {
                min-height: 330px;
                padding: 28px;
            }


            .story-title {
                font-size: 38px;
            }


            .stories-closing {
                padding:
                    105px 0
                    120px;
            }


            .closing-title {
                font-size: clamp(
                    57px,
                    18vw,
                    82px
                );
            }


            .closing-copy {
                margin-top: 48px;
                margin-left: 0;
                font-size: 14px;
            }


            .footer-bottom {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
                margin-top: 65px;
            }


            #closeMenu {
                top: 17px;
                right: 17px;
            }


            .navigation-inner {
                width: calc(100% - 44px);
            }


            .navigation-links a {
                font-size: 34px;
                padding: 14px 0;
            }

        }


        /* =================================================
           REDUCED MOTION
        ================================================== */

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {

            html {
                scroll-behavior: auto;
            }


            *,
            *::before,
            *::after {
                animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
                animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
                transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
            }

        }

    </style>

</head>


<body>


    <!-- =================================================
         PAGE TRANSITION
    ================================================== -->

    <div
        id="pageTransition"
        aria-hidden="true"
    ></div>


    <!-- =================================================
         HEADER
    ================================================== -->

    <header class="stories-header">

        <a
            href="index.html"
            class="stories-brand"
            aria-label="Return to AKSH arrival"
        >

            <img
                src="aksh-icon.PNG"
                alt="AKSH"
            >

        </a>


        <button
            id="menuButton"
            type="button"
            aria-label="Open navigation"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="navigation"
        >

            <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span aria-hidden="true"></span>

        </button>

    </header>


    <!-- =================================================
         HERO
    ================================================== -->

    <main>


        <section
            class="stories-hero"
            aria-labelledby="storiesHeroTitle"
        >

            <div
                class="hero-glow"
                aria-hidden="true"
            ></div>


            <div class="hero-content">

                <div class="hero-label">
                    AKSH — STORIES
                </div>


                <h1
                    id="storiesHeroTitle"
                    class="hero-title"
                >

                    Every mind
                    <em>has a story.</em>

                </h1>


                <p class="hero-intro">

                    Stories can help us recognise
                    experiences we thought only we
                    were carrying.

                </p>

            </div>


            <div
                class="hero-scroll"
                aria-hidden="true"
            >

                <span>
                    Explore
                </span>

                <span class="scroll-line"></span>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- =================================================
             INTRODUCTION
        ================================================== -->

        <section class="stories-introduction">

            <div class="content-width">

                <span class="section-number">
                    01 — STORIES
                </span>


                <h2 class="introduction-title">

                    Not every story needs
                    <em>an ending.</em>

                </h2>


                <p class="introduction-copy">

                    Sometimes a story simply gives
                    shape to something we have been
                    trying to understand.

                    <br><br>

                    AKSH Stories is envisioned as a
                    space for reflections, experiences,
                    perspectives and conversations
                    around mental wellness and being human.

                </p>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- =================================================
             STORY LIBRARY
        ================================================== -->

        <section class="stories-library">

            <div class="content-width">

                <span class="section-number">
                    02 — EXPLORE
                </span>


                <h2 class="library-heading">

                    Stories that make
                    <em>space for understanding.</em>

                </h2>


                <p class="library-copy">

                    A growing collection of thoughtful
                    perspectives around emotions,
                    relationships, identity, growth,
                    uncertainty and everyday life.

                </p>


                <div class="stories-grid">


                    <article class="story-card">

                        <span class="story-number">
                            01
                        </span>


                        <div class="story-card-content">

                            <p class="story-category">
                                Reflection
                            </p>


                            <h3 class="story-title">
                                The things we
                                don't say.
                            </h3>


                            <p class="story-description">

                                Sometimes what remains
                                unspoken carries more
                                weight than the words
                                we choose.

                            </p>

                        </div>


                        <span
                            class="story-arrow"
                            aria-hidden="true"
                        >
                            →
                        </span>

                    </article>


                    <article class="story-card">

                        <span class="story-number">
                            02
                        </span>


                        <div class="story-card-content">

                            <p class="story-category">
                                Understanding
                            </p>


                            <h3 class="story-title">
                                When being
                                okay feels difficult.
                            </h3>


                            <p class="story-description">

                                There can be a difference
                                between appearing fine
                                and genuinely feeling
                                supported.

                            </p>

                        </div>


                        <span
                            class="story-arrow"
                            aria-hidden="true"
                        >
                            →
                        </span>

                    </article>


                    <article class="story-card">

                        <span class="story-number">
                            03
                        </span>


                        <div class="story-card-content">

                            <p class="story-category">
                                Relationships
                            </p>


                            <h3 class="story-title">
                                Learning to
                                ask for space.
                            </h3>


                            <p class="story-description">

                                Boundaries can be an
                                important part of caring
                                for ourselves and the
                                relationships around us.

                            </p>

